{"id":"en_the-defense-never-rests","title":"The Defense Never Rests","titleEn":"The Defense Never Rests","description":"Qin Zhengshu has earned the nickname \"Grim Reaper of the Law\" thanks to an unblemished courtroom record. When Duan Chengzhou, the son of Longcheng's richest tycoon Duan Hairong, faces rape charges, he retains Qin Zhengshu to win an acquittal. After learning that Qin has agreed to take the case, Duan Chengzhou encounters Qin Hao, Qin Zhengshu's son, and his pregnant wife Li Qing at a hot pot restaurant. Acting with arrogance and a sense of entitlement, Duan Chengzhou harasses and humiliates the couple. Qin Zhengshu shows up at the crucial moment and identifies himself, yet Duan Chengzhou dismisses him and keeps up the attack, departing only when the trial is about to begin. In court, as the defense attorney comes forward, the once-smug Duan Chengzhou is stunned—the man he insulted is the ve","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-defense-never-rests/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-defense-never-rests/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Business Conflicts","Shocking Twist","Justice Served","All-Too-Late","Counterattack","Elite"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv7tg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-defense-never-rests_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv7tg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-defense-never-rests_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dv7tg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-defense-never-rests_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","l